    "body": "Can we not end up in a situation where hide returns early without changing the state? E.g., if hide all popovers made some changes.\r\n\r\nI think we have to return something at the end based on the current state, instead. This might need test coverage too as @rwlbuis's WebKit implementation didn't catch this. (Assuming I'm correct.)",
